  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto has officially awarded the title of National Hero to 19 distinguished individuals from various professional backgrounds.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto granted the official National Hero title to 19 figures from diverse regions and sectors.",
    "Among those recognized are RM Margono Djojohadikusumo, Jenderal Hoegeng, Kiai Abbas, and Letkol Sroedji.",
    "Regional leaders and officials highlighted the significance of these honors in inspiring younger generations."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto has officially conferred the status of National Hero upon 19 individuals as a tribute to their contributions and sacrifices for Indonesia. The list includes notable historical figures such as RM Margono Djojohadikusumo, the guerilla commander Letkol Sroedji, the police figure Jenderal Hoegeng, religious leader Kiai Abbas, and Sultan Ibrahim Chaliludin of Paser. The announcement has been met with supportive statements from regional officials, including the Governor of Central Java and local leadership in Pekanbaru, who described the recognitions as a source of pride and an opportunity for the public to learn from these legacies. The conferral ceremony was attended by various state representatives and local stakeholders, emphasizing the nationwide scope of the honors. These awards follow a formal selection process to celebrate individuals who have demonstrated exceptional service and commitment to the nation throughout its history.",
